  "source_reconciliation": [
    "Apply final monthly meter reading rule in Sheet 25.8 and matching revenue-month season. ESRR 80.09 starts June 2; the supported June final read qualifies.",
    "The October index specifies October 1 for DCI but its book contains superseded 103.45. Separate filed 103.46 sets 18.624% from October 1.",
    "Sheet 85.2 predates DSM/DSMR, the DM DDR addition, the USR to PIPP rename, and the Sheet 126.5 PSR withdrawal. Individual later rider applicability governs.",
    "SGF and LGR are zero after August 14, 2025 per filed sheets. Workbook and PTC are cross-checks, not component substitutes or daily rate authority.",
    "Official OET Sheet 83.6 and both calculator editions use 2000/15000 kWh retail block boundaries. Statutory distributor remittance includes separate non-30-day rules."
  ],
  "unsupported": "All other 2025–2026 months and unmatched/shifted cycles; complete contemporaneous rider and allocation evidence has not been established."
